      "page": "s01",
      "text": "SETTLED\nMain menu as home · Auburn always on home · status: last workout · list: Start workout, Past workouts, Exercises, Splits and gyms, Overdue log, Settings; three show while down; RESUME WORKOUT while one is in progress · glyph C on every entry · widgets: Rest at a glance, Goals, Cardio; each a cover, its name, basic info and an Edit button, and opens its screen; Edit gives up, down (one place in reading order), and half or full width · the widget area scrolls under the list · covers are drawn per widget, after your cleaned-up terminal icons; Rest's cover is your traced bust; the tinted figure lives on the Rest screen only · no overdue, workout-in-progress or date line on home · layers: content, then list, then power down on top, fixed at the bottom edge · Power down by press and hold · the overdue prompt opens over this screen · widget info: Rest — how many groups are in Train or Overdue, what is overdue; Goals — how many goals, the latest progress; Cardio — days since the last activity, the last run · covers and icons: Gelasio 700, short names, 1 px title rules · palette roles: screen Tube, list Trial A #212220, power down Tube, accent Ember, ink Obsidian, light Cyan White · widget titles on an Ember fill in ink",
